A null spelling lands as a YAML null, unquoted.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md retro=null
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
+retro: null
 ---
 
 # Foo
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: retro=null
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
retro: null
---

# Foo

